      ],
      "text": "lower risk for adverse events (RR 0.33, 95% CI 0.20 ; 0.56) and a higher adherence rate (RR 1.07, 95%",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
