        80.59070587158203,
        527.4406127929688,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "CI 1.01 ; 1.14) among children given daily rifampicin plus isoniazid. Similar findings were reported in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        92.51471710205078,
        220.95950317382812,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "(89,91) the observational studies  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.37223052978516,
        118.65733337402344,
        384.11236572265625,
        136.92733764648438
      ],
      "text": "Daily rifapentine plus isoniazid for 1 month (1HP)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        143.63319396972656,
        527.53515625,
        158.07618713378906
      ],
      "text": "Before updating the 2020 guidelines, the GDG considered data from the only known published study",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.992497444152832,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        156.83314514160156,
        527.5537719726562,
        171.27613830566406
      ],
      "text": "of the 1HP regimen: a randomized, open-label, phase 3 non-inferiority trial of the efficacy and safety",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.999199867248535,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        170.03309631347656,
        527.398193359375,
        184.47608947753906
      ],
      "text": "of 1HP as compared with 9 months of isoniazid alone (9H) in people with HIV aged ≥ 13 years in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.9571075439453,
        527.4089965820312,
        197.6761016845703
      ],
      "text": "(92) areas of high TB prevalence or who had evidence of TBI  . Enrolment was restricted to individuals",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        196.43324279785156,
        527.303955078125,
        210.87623596191406
      ],
      "text": "who were not pregnant or breastfeeding. Noninferiority would be shown if the upper limit of the 95%",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.987592697143555,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        209.63319396972656,
        527.4362182617188,
        224.07618713378906
      ],
      "text": "confidence interval for the between-group difference in the number of events per 100 person-years",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        222.83314514160156,
        527.1759033203125,
        237.27613830566406
      ],
      "text": "was < 1.25. For all study participants, the difference in the incidence rate of TB (including deaths from",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98819351196289,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        236.03309631347656,
        527.4013061523438,
        250.47608947753906
      ],
      "text": "any cause) between 1HP and 9H (i.e. 1HP arm minus 9H arm) was −0.02 per 100 person-years (95%",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        249.2331085205078,
        527.3936767578125,
        263.6761169433594
      ],
      "text": "CI −0.35 ; +0.30); the RR for treatment completion of 1HP as compared with 9H was 1.04 (95% CI,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        262.4332275390625,
        527.384765625,
        276.8762512207031
      ],
      "text": "0.99 ; 1.10); the RR for grade 3–5 adverse events was 0.86 (95% CI, 0.58 ; 1.27); the hazard ratio for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        275.63323974609375,
        527.39892578125,
        290.0762634277344
      ],
      "text": "death from any cause was 0.75 in favour of 1HP (95% CI, 0.42 ; 1.31); and the RRs for emergence of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        288.8331298828125,
        527.4168090820312,
        303.2761535644531
      ],
      "text": "resistance to isoniazid and rifampicin were, respectively, 1.63 (95% CI, 0.17 ; 15.99) and 0.81 (95%",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        302.03314208984375,
        527.4360961914062,
        316.4761657714844
      ],
      "text": "CI, 0.06 ; 11.77). Overall non-inferiority as defined by the study protocol was shown in the modified",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        315.233154296875,
        527.4135131835938,
        329.6761779785156
      ],
      "text": "intention-to-treat population. Non-inferiority was also shown for the sub-group with confirmed TBI",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        328.43316650390625,
        527.4190063476562,
        342.8761901855469
      ],
      "text": "(incidence rate difference per 100 person-years = 0.069 [–0.830 to 0.690]) in males and females and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        341.63311767578125,
        527.4215698242188,
        356.0762023925781
      ],
      "text": ",  among people on or not on ART at the start of the study. Few patients had a CD4+ < 250 cells/mm 3",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86602783203125,
        354.8331298828125,
        527.6024780273438,
        369.2761535644531
      ],
      "text": "and neither inferiority or noninferiority of 1HP was shown in this stratum. The evidence for this",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        378.80169677734375,
        368.0331115722656,
        424.6937255859375,
        382.47613525390625
      ],
      "text": "annexes 3",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        424.69769287109375,
        368.0331115722656,
        445.1907043457031,
        382.47613525390625
      ],
      "text": "and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
