        70.86602783203125,
        368.0331115722656,
        456.3153991699219,
        382.4761657714844
      ],
      "text": ". recommendation is summarized in the GRADE tables for PICO 7 in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.37223052978516,
        392.8996887207031,
        375.19158935546875,
        411.1697082519531
      ],
      "text": "Daily rifampicin monotherapy for 4 months (4R)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        417.8757019042969,
        527.2911376953125,
        432.3187255859375
      ],
      "text": "A systematic review conducted for the 2015 TPT guidelines and updated in 2017 found similar efficacy",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.967652320861816,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        429.7995910644531,
        527.450439453125,
        445.51861572265625
      ],
      "text": "(80,88) for 3–4 months’ daily rifampicin and 6H (odds ratio, 0.78; 95% CI, 0.41 ; 1.46)  . The review also",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.997849464416504,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        444.27569580078125,
        527.1504516601562,
        458.7187194824219
      ],
      "text": "showed that individuals given rifampicin daily for 3–4 months had a lower risk for hepatotoxicity than",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.99484920501709,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        457.4757080078125,
        401.24017333984375,
        471.9187316894531
      ],
      "text": "those treated with isoniazid monotherapy (OR 0.03; 95% CI 0.00 ; 0.48).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        479.1795959472656,
        527.4322509765625,
        493.62261962890625
      ],
      "text": "Before the 2020 guidelines were updated, the GDG discussed the implications of using 4R in high",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        492.3796081542969,
        527.37548828125,
        506.8226318359375
      ],
      "text": "TB burden settings based on findings from RCTs of 4R vs 9H that included adults and children in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        504.3035888671875,
        527.3956298828125,
        520.0225830078125
      ],
      "text": "(93–96) such countries  . In study participants aged > 17 years, the difference in rate of confirmed TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        518.7796020507812,
        527.3946533203125,
        533.2225952148438
      ],
      "text": "between 4R and 9H (4R arm minus 9H arm) was < 0.01 cases per 100 person-years (95% CI, −0.14 ;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        531.9796142578125,
        527.4234619140625,
        546.422607421875
      ],
      "text": "0.16); the difference in treatment completion was 15.1% (95% CI, 12.7 ; 17.4); and the difference in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        545.1796264648438,
        527.385986328125,
        559.6226196289062
      ],
      "text": "grade 3–5 adverse events was −1.1% (95% CI −1.9 ; –0.4). In individuals < 18 years, the difference",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        558.379638671875,
        527.3803100585938,
        572.8226318359375
      ],
      "text": "in the rate of TB disease between 4R and 9H was –0.37 cases per 100 person-years (95% CI, −0.88 ;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        571.57958984375,
        527.239013671875,
        586.0225830078125
      ],
      "text": "0.14); the difference in treatment completion was 13.4% (95% CI, 7.5 ; 19.3); and the difference in risk",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.994297981262207,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        584.7796020507812,
        527.4365844726562,
        599.2225952148438
      ],
      "text": "for adverse events attributed to the medicine used and resulting in discontinuation was −0.0 (95%",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        597.9796142578125,
        527.3905029296875,
        612.422607421875
      ],
      "text": "CI, −0.1 ; 0.1). The evidence for this revised recommendation is summarized in the GRADE tables for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
