        70.37223052978516,
        636.0462646484375,
        362.1210021972656,
        654.3162231445312
      ],
      "text": "Implementation and subgroup considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        661.0220947265625,
        527.4332275390625,
        675.465087890625
      ],
      "text": "The GDG agreed that the benefits of all the treatment options being recommended outweigh their",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        674.2221069335938,
        527.6142578125,
        688.6651000976562
      ],
      "text": "potential harm. Programmes and clinicians should also consider the characteristics of each individual",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.997650146484375,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        687.422119140625,
        527.4346313476562,
        701.8651123046875
      ],
      "text": "concerned to maximize the likelihood that treatment is completed as expected. The decision on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        700.6220703125,
        527.4388427734375,
        715.0650634765625
      ],
      "text": "which treatment to offer should not be confined to the manner in which it was studied in a trial (e.g.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        713.8220825195312,
        527.3969116210938,
        728.2650756835938
      ],
      "text": "1HP to replace 9H) but by considerations such as age, risk of toxicity or interaction, co-morbidity,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        727.0220947265625,
        527.43505859375,
        741.465087890625
      ],
      "text": "drug susceptibility of the strain of the most likely source case, availability – including child-friendly",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        740.2221069335938,
        527.40478515625,
        754.6651000976562
      ],
      "text": "formulations – and the individual’s preferences. All recommended treatment options are possible in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
